  "statuteText": "374:49 Damage Prevention System. –\n\nEach operator shall participate in an underground facility damage prevention system. The system shall operate during regular business hours throughout the year, except Saturdays, Sundays and legal holidays. The system shall receive notices of proposed excavations and transmit such notices to its members."
